<view class="device-page" style="{{displayStyle}}">
  <view class="device-intro">
    <text class="device-intro-kicker">设备管理</text>
    <text class="device-intro-title">管理你的血糖设备</text>
    <text class="device-intro-note">查看同步状态，必要时可解绑或重新添加</text>
  </view>

  <view class="summary-card">
    <view class="summary-item">
      <text class="summary-value">{{boundCount}}</text>
      <text class="summary-label">已绑定</text>
    </view>
    <view class="summary-item">
      <text class="summary-value">{{drafts.length}}</text>
      <text class="summary-label">待适配</text>
    </view>
    <view class="summary-item">
      <text class="summary-value">{{lastSyncLabel}}</text>
      <text class="summary-label">距上次同步</text>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="device-section-heading">
    <text>已绑定设备</text>
    <text class="section-side-note">{{boundDevices.length}} 台</text>
  </view>
  <view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="section-empty">正在加载设备…</view>
  <view wx:elif="{{loadError}}" class="section-empty" bindtap="refresh" aria-role="button">{{loadError}} · 点击重试</view>
  <view wx:elif="{{!boundDevices.length}}" class="section-empty">
    <text>暂无已绑定设备，可通过下方按钮添加</text>
  </view>
  <view wx:for="{{boundDevices}}" wx:key="id" class="manage-item">
    <view class="manage-top">
      <view class="nearby-device-icon"><view class="mini-device-screen"></view></view>
      <view class="manage-main">
        <view class="manage-name-row">
          <text class="manage-name">{{item.deviceName}}</text>
          <text class="status-badge {{item.online ? 'badge-ok' : 'badge-offline'}}">{{item.statusText}}</text>
        </view>
        <text class="manage-meta">{{item.providerName}} · SN：{{item.deviceSn}}</text>
        <text class="manage-sync">{{item.syncText}}</text>
      </view>
    </view>
    <view class="manage-actions">
      <button class="action-btn" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="onSync" disabled="{{loading}}" hover-class="method-pressed">{{item.syncActionText}}</button>
      <button class="action-btn ghost" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="onDetail" hover-class="method-pressed">详情</button>
      <button class="action-btn danger" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="onUnbind" disabled="{{unbinding}}" hover-class="method-pressed">解绑</button>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="device-section-heading">
    <text>待适配设备</text>
    <text class="section-side-note">会话内临时 · {{drafts.length}} 台</text>
  </view>
  <view wx:if="{{!drafts.length}}" class="section-empty">
    <text>暂无待适配设备；扫码 / SN / 蓝牙登记后会出现在此</text>
  </view>
  <view wx:for="{{drafts}}" wx:key="id" class="manage-item">
    <view class="manage-top">
      <view class="nearby-device-icon"><view class="mini-device-screen"></view></view>
      <view class="manage-main">
        <view class="manage-name-row">
          <text class="manage-name">{{item.name}}</text>
          <text class="status-badge badge-pending">待适配 · 未绑定</text>
        </view>
        <text class="manage-meta">SN：{{item.sn || '未填写'}} · 来源：{{item.sourceText}}</text>
        <text class="manage-sync">仅本地会话登记，暂无设备读数</text>
      </view>
    </view>
    <view class="manage-actions">
      <button
        wx:if="{{item.sn}}"
        class="action-btn"
        data-id="{{item.id}}"
        bindtap="onConfirmBind"
        hover-class="method-pressed"
      >确认绑定</button>
      <button
        wx:else
        class="action-btn ghost"
        data-id="{{item.id}}"
        bindtap="onSupplementSn"
        hover-class="method-pressed"
      >补充 SN</button>
      <button class="action-btn danger" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="onRemoveDraft" hover-class="method-pressed">移除</button>
    </view>
  </view>

  <button class="search-button secondary add-another" bindtap="onAddDevice" hover-class="search-button-pressed">添加另一台设备</button>

  <view class="device-preparation-note">
    <text class="preparation-title">状态说明</text>
    <text>绑定后可查看设备详情和最近同步时间。待适配设备仅临时登记；实际测量数据需完成对应设备接入后才能同步。</text>
  </view>

  <view wx:if="{{detailVisible}}" class="serial-overlay">
    <view class="serial-mask" bindtap="onCloseDetail"></view>
    <view class="serial-panel" catchtap="noop">
      <view class="serial-heading">
        <text>设备详情</text>
        <text class="serial-close" bindtap="onCloseDetail" aria-role="button">关闭</text>
      </view>
      <text class="serial-note">{{detail.deviceName}}</text>
      <text class="detail-line">序列号：{{detail.deviceSn}}</text>
      <text class="detail-line">设备来源：{{detail.providerName}}</text>
      <text class="detail-line">状态：{{detail.statusText}}</text>
      <text class="detail-line">最近同步：{{detail.lastSyncDisplay}}</text>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view wx:if="{{snVisible}}" class="serial-overlay">
    <view class="serial-mask" bindtap="onCloseSn"></view>
    <view class="serial-panel" catchtap="noop">
      <view class="serial-heading">
        <text>补充 SN</text>
        <text class="serial-close" bindtap="onCloseSn" aria-role="button">取消</text>
      </view>
      <text class="serial-note">填写机身或包装上的序列号，写入本条待适配记录后即可确认绑定。</text>
      <text class="input-label">设备 SN <text class="required-mark">*</text></text>
      <input class="serial-input" value="{{snInput}}" maxlength="64" placeholder="请输入设备 SN 码" placeholder-class="serial-placeholder" bindinput="onSnInput" />
      <text wx:if="{{snError}}" class="serial-error">{{snError}}</text>
      <button class="search-button serial-save" bindtap="onSaveSn">保存序列号</button>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view wx:if="{{bindVisible}}" class="serial-overlay">
    <view class="serial-mask" bindtap="onCloseBind"></view>
    <view class="serial-panel" catchtap="noop">
      <view class="serial-heading">
        <text>确认绑定</text>
        <text wx:if="{{!binding}}" class="serial-close" bindtap="onCloseBind" aria-role="button">取消</text>
      </view>
      <text class="serial-note">确认设备来源和序列号后，绑定到当前账号：{{bindDraft.sn}}</text>
      <text class="input-label">设备名称 <text class="optional-label">（选填）</text></text>
      <input class="serial-input" value="{{bindName}}" maxlength="40" placeholder="例如：我的血糖仪" placeholder-class="serial-placeholder" bindinput="onBindNameInput" disabled="{{binding}}" />
      <text class="input-label">设备来源 <text class="required-mark">*</text></text>
      <view class="provider-grid">
        <view
          wx:for="{{providers}}"
          wx:key="code"
          class="provider-chip {{bindProvider === item.code ? 'on' : ''}}"
          data-provider="{{item.code}}"
          bindtap="onPickProvider"
        >{{item.name}}</view>
      </view>
      <button class="search-button serial-save" loading="{{binding}}" disabled="{{binding}}" bindtap="onSubmitBind">确认绑定到账号</button>
      <text class="serial-footnote">绑定成功后可查看详情、刷新状态或解绑</text>
    </view>
  </view>
</view>
